				"Carry On lets you move many chests, barrels and creatures. Check its keybind, use both hands where required, and do not relocate another player's things without asking."
				"Carry On moves many containers and small entities when you sneak and use the configured interaction. Empty or secure anything irreplaceable before experimenting, because a useful shortcut is still capable of moving the wrong block."
