				"FallingTree speeds up logging. Larger trees consume more durability, so bring a healthy axe and avoid dropping a canopy onto your friends."
				"Falling Tree accelerates timber work, but one tree can drop many entities at once. Replant as you harvest and avoid felling giant trees beside detailed builds, pets, or other players."
