		{
			dependencies: ["341C28816B831FA9"]
			description: [
				"Beautify adds trellises, lamps, book stacks and workstations. Detail focal areas instead of filling every wall with clutter."
				"Start with silhouette and purpose, then choose a small palette, then add depth. Furniture and detail blocks work best when they explain how a room is used instead of covering every empty surface."
				"If the expected result does not appear, preserve the failed setup and compare its recipe, tooltip, environment, orientation, required interaction, keybind, and available space with one known-good example. Change one variable at a time until the cause is proven."
			]
