				"Rechiseled turns one material into many coordinated textures. Use its chisel and keep strong patterns for trims, floors or feature walls."
				"Rechiseled supplies coordinated texture families; FramedBlocks supplies unusual shapes that borrow another block's appearance. Decide texture first and geometry second so an accent does not turn into visual noise."
